  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "SMB2: Fix compilation on MSYS2",
  "description": "On normal Windows SYMLINK_FLAG_RELATIVE is defined in ntifs.h (which\nwe don't include by default), but in the case of MSYS2 it is defined\nin winnt.h (which is included by windows.h), and so defining it in\nthe dissector can cause a redefinition warning especially with\nhex vs. decimal issues:\n\nwireshark/epan/dissectors/packet-smb2.c:1218:9: error: 'SYMLINK_FLAG_RELATIVE' redefined [-Werror]\n 1218 | #define SYMLINK_FLAG_RELATIVE 0x00000001\n      |         ^~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\nIn file included from C:/msys64/ucrt64/include/minwindef.h:163,\n                 from C:/msys64/ucrt64/include/windef.h:9,\n                 from C:/msys64/ucrt64/include/windows.h:69,\n                 from C:/msys64/home/johnt/wireshark/epan/dissectors/packet-smb2.c:52:\nC:/msys64/ucrt64/include/winnt.h:6402:9: note: this is the location of the previous definition\n 6402 | #define SYMLINK_FLAG_RELATIVE   1\n      |         ^~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n\nFixup 692a66d05d8a467a9a5eda29c09337b9362e3147\n\nhttps://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows-hardware/drivers/ddi/ntifs/ns-ntifs-_reparse_data_buffer\n\nAI-Assisted: no",
  "state": "merged",
